    "The photo shows %@ %@. Astrum records this in %@ and does not convert: enter it in %@ by hand." : {
      "comment" : "A note explaining that the photo shows a value in a different unit than the one expected by the analyser. The first argument is the value shown in the photo. The second argument is the unit shown in the photo.",
