            "value" : "The photo shows %1$@ %2$@. Astrum records this in %3$@ and does not convert: enter it in %4$@ by hand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photo stays on this phone and is discarded when you close this screen." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the photo that stays on the phone and is discarded when the screen is closed.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The test alert arrives after five seconds, so there is time to lock the phone. On a locked phone, alerts also show on the Apple Watch." : {
